{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47247","headline":"荅宋之问 · 司马承祯","name":"荅宋之问","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"时既暮兮节欲春，山林寂兮怀幽人。\n登奇峰兮望白云，怅缅邈兮象欲纷。\n白云悠悠去不返，寒风飕飕吹日晚。\n不见其人谁与言，归坐弹琴思逾远。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司马承祯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}